{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj51SBniPjxuAL1sm3Z8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, worn door. Its surface is unmarked except for a single keyhole, dark and deep, positioned at its center — not where a keyhole should be, but where a heart would be.*\n\n*The keyhole breathes. A faint warm draft escapes from within, carrying the scent of something you forgot long ago — your childhood bedroom, or a word you used to know.*\n\n*You have no key.*\n\n*But the keyhole shifts, almost imperceptibly, reshaping itself as you look closer. It is not waiting for a key.*\n\n*It is waiting to see what shape you are.*\n\n    ┌─────────────────────┐\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │          ◊          │\n    │         ╱ ╲         │\n    │        │   │        │\n    │         ╲ ╱         │\n    │          ▼          │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    │                     │\n    └─────────────────────┘\n\n*What do you offer?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":271,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}